<title>USA: Trump, Rank says announcement.</title>
<headline>Trump, Rank says announcement.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A top executive at Donald Trump Hotels &amp; Casino Resorts Inc said on Monday a press conference scheduled for Tuesday in New York City is back on.  </p>
<p>News of the press conference being held on Tuesday as announced came moments after a Hard Rock Cafe spokesman said logistical problems had forced a delay of the event.</p>
<p>The annoucement is expected to detail Trump Hotels' agreement with Rank Organisation Plc that will result in the renovation of Trump's Castle in Atlantic City into a Hard Rock Cafe and Casino.</p>
<p>Rank is expected to pay $50 million for the transformation and will share in the resort's profits.</p>
</text>
